            "value": "G. Baatz, K. Koser, D. Chen, R. Grzeszczuk, and M. Pollefeys, \"Leveraging 3D city models for rotation invariant place-of-interest recognition\", International Journal on Computer Vision, Vol. 94, No. 5, May 2011.",
